parameters.text:
=Generate a professional supplier inquiry email with the following details:

Supplier: {{ $("Get Supplier Info").item.json.company_name }}
Contact: {{ $("Get Supplier Info").item.json.contact_name }}
Product: {{ $("Receive Inquiry Request").item.json.body.productName }}
Quantity: {{ $("Receive Inquiry Request").item.json.body.quantity }}
Deadline: {{ $("Receive Inquiry Request").item.json.body.deadline }}
Budget: ${{ $("Receive Inquiry Request").item.json.body.budget }}

Request the following information:
- Price per unit
- Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ)
- Lead time for delivery
- Payment terms
- Quality certifications

Sign as Marcus Chen, Procurement Manager at ChainMind Supply Intelligence.
Use a professional, courteous tone. Return only the email body text without subject line.

parameters.jsonBody:
={{ {
  "status": "success",
  "messageId": $("Send Inquiry Email").item.json.id,
  "threadId": $("Send Inquiry Email").item.json.threadId,
  "recipient": $("Get Supplier Info").item.json.contact_email,
  "timestamp": $("Log Sent Email").item.json.sent_at,
  "replyReceived": $("Check For Reply").item.json.thread_id ? true : false,
  "followUpSent": $("Check For Reply").item.json.thread_id ? false : true,
  "nextReminderTime": $("Check For Reply").item.json.thread_id ? null : $now.plus({ days: 1 }).toISO()
} }}

parameters.text:
=Generate a friendly follow-up email for the supplier inquiry sent 24 hours ago.

Original inquiry details:
Supplier: {{ $("Get Supplier Info").item.json.company_name }}
Product: {{ $("Receive Inquiry Request").item.json.body.productName }}
Quantity: {{ $("Receive Inquiry Request").item.json.body.quantity }}

Politely remind them of the inquiry and request a response. Mention the deadline is approaching. Sign as Marcus Chen, Procurement Manager at ChainMind Supply Intelligence. Keep it brief and professional. Return only the email body text.

parameters.jsonBody:
={{ {
  "supplierId": $("Match Supplier").item.json.id,
  "companyName": $("Match Supplier").item.json.company_name,
  "senderEmail": $("Check Gmail Every 5 Minutes").item.json.from.value[0].address,
  "subject": $("Check Gmail Every 5 Minutes").item.json.subject,
  "receivedAt": $("Check Gmail Every 5 Minutes").item.json.date,
  "emailBody": $("Check Gmail Every 5 Minutes").item.json.text,
  "extractedQuote": JSON.parse($("Extract Quote Information").item.json.output)
} }}

parameters.text:
=Generate a friendly follow-up email for a supplier inquiry that has not received a response.

Supplier: {{ $("Find Pending Emails").item.json.company_name }}
Contact: {{ $("Find Pending Emails").item.json.contact_name }}
Original Subject: {{ $("Find Pending Emails").item.json.subject }}
Inquiry Details: {{ $("Find Pending Emails").item.json.inquiry_details }}
Days Since Sent: {{ Math.floor(($now.toMillis() - new Date($("Find Pending Emails").item.json.sent_at).getTime()) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24)) }}

Write a polite follow-up that:
- References the original inquiry
- Restates the key requirements
- Requests an urgent response within 2-3 days
- Maintains a professional and courteous tone

Sign as Marcus Chen, Procurement Manager at ChainMind Supply Intelligence. Return only the email body text.

parameters.jsonBody:
={{ {
  "supplierId": $("Find Pending Emails").item.json.supplier_id,
  "companyName": $("Find Pending Emails").item.json.company_name,
  "followUpSent": true,
  "sentAt": $now.toISO(),
  "responseDeadline": $now.plus({ days: 3 }).toISO(),
  "threadId": $("Find Pending Emails").item.json.thread_id
} }}

